      "text": "# Bundle patch layer: one host row for the knowledge base itself.\n#\n# The entry id doubles as the plugin's settings namespace. `enabled: false`\n# keeps the package installed while switching the tools off.\n#\n# dbPath 留空时落在 $DSH_HOME/kb/kb.db —— 与会话文件同域，迁移备份一起走。\n#\n# ui 关掉只停 /api/dsh-kb/*（面板随之打不开）；工具与系统提示不受影响。\n# 行 id 是设置命名空间（面板 id 也用它），name 才是模块名。\n#\n# mirrorDir 留空 = 库旁边的 mirror/：Markdown 镜像跟着库一起备份、一起迁移。\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-kb\n      name: \"@myremme/dsh-kb\"\n      config:\n        enabled: true\n        dbPath: \"\"\n        maxResults: 6\n        promptSection: true\n        ui: true\n        bootFacts: 6\n        ingestEveryMinutes: 0\n        staleDays: 30\n        mirrorDir: \"\"\n"
